window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Darcy doesn't like young ladies who unsettle his inner equilibrium, <br> especially those whose impertinent comments offend the inborn pride of his position.</p> <p>Elizabeth Bennet doesn't like proud, arrogant gentlemen, <br> especially those who make disparaging comments about her and her family.</p> <p>Neither of them like being forced to stay under the same roof, <br> especially where circumstances prevent them meeting directly.</p> <p>Each has to imagine what the other is really like. But how can they really know? <br> And which one do they really love?</p> <p><i>Imagining Mr. Darcy</i> is a sweet and clean Regency novel.</p>"; 
